<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Candlewood Hotel started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities said its analyst Michael Mueller started coverage of Candlewood Hotel Co Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were unavailable.</p>
